\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {5}{\ignorespaces Mechanism. Left: the cross-prompt component of the exact drift of $\log \pi _\theta (h\mid x)$ at the base model (Lemma~\ref {lem:drift}), identically zero for per-prompt parameters as Corollary~\ref {cor:tabular} requires. Centre: mean pairwise cosine between per-prompt gradients, the coherence of Definition~\ref {def:coherent}, measured rather than assumed. Right: contiguous versus randomized block membership.}}{18}{}\protected@file@percent }
